ise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대출상환</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">으로 표기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대출금이 있으나 장학금액 보다 적은 경우 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대출상환 후 일부 금액만 학생에게 지급 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바